sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Person
  participant A as App (Plans page)
  participant W as Billing worker
  participant F as Firestore
  participant N as NOWPayments
  P->>A: Choose Pro, pick months (1 to 12)
  A->>W: POST /checkout {kind: plan, planId, months} + Firebase token
  W->>W: Verify token, price the plan HERE (never from the browser)
  W->>F: Create tweaks_payments/{id} status = pending
  W->>N: Create hosted invoice (amount, order_id = payment id)
  N-->>W: invoice id and checkout address
  W->>F: Save invoiceId on the payment
  W-->>A: {checkoutUrl, reference}
  A->>P: Send to the payment page
  P->>N: Pays in crypto
  N->>W: POST /webhook/nowpayments (HMAC-SHA512 signed)
  W->>W: Check signature, amount, currency, payment record
  W->>F: One commit: payment = paid, user plan = pro, planUntil + months
  P->>A: Comes back to /plans?payment=id
  loop every 4 s, up to 3 min
    A->>F: Read my payment
  end
  A->>P: "Paid. Thank you."
